# REST API

### Get All Profiles
### curl http://localhost:3000/profile
GET http://localhost:3000/profile

### Create New Profile
### curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/profile
POST http://localhost:3000/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "demo7",
    "password": "1234",
    "mobile": "0999999994",
    "cardId": "1234567890119"
}

### Get some profile by id
GET http://localhost:3000/profile/

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "boon01",
    "password": "12345678"
}

# REST API

### Encode (เหมือน POST /profile)
POST http://localhost:3000/encode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "boon01",
  "password": "12345678",
  "mobile": "0812345678",
  "cardId": "1234567890123"
}

### Decode (เหมือน GET /profile/:id)
POST http://localhost:3000/decode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "dfa1693f-7698-49c1-9c79-26a6d1c661bd"
}
